<GuideArticle slug="aruba-carnival-2027-dates-parade-routes"
  title="Aruba Carnival 2027: dates, parades and where to watch"
  metaTitle="Aruba Carnival 2027 — Dates, Grand Parade & Where to Watch in Oranjestad"
